.TH BLACKDIAMOND 1
.SH NAME
blackdiamond \- downhill skiing game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/blackdiamond
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BlackDiamond
is a downhill skiing game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Ski downhill past obstacles on a depth-scaled slope. Steer left and right; collisions add penalty.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left
Move skier left (wrap)
.TP
.B Right
Move skier right (wrap)
.TP
.B Enter / r / space
Restart after game over
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/blackdiamond.b
